BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nudge 1/60: Name one specific thing
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261102T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261102T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-they-2026-11-02-1@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Send them a message today naming one specific thing the
 y did this week that made your life easier. Not 'thanks for everything'. T
 he actual thing: 'Thanks for sorting the car insurance. I know that was fo
 rty minutes on hold.'\n\nWHY IT WORKS: Specific thanks shows you were payi
 ng attention. General thanks sounds like politeness.\n\nDay 1 of 60 · Wee
 k 1: Notice\n\nTCH Works · Better Partner Plan. Everyday relationship ide
 as\, not therapy or counselling. If things feel unsafe or overwhelming\, t
 alk to your GP or a relationship counselling service. In an emergency call
  999.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.tchworks.co.uk/planners/u/185521ab6e704744/
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Nudge 1/60: Name one specific thing
TRIGGER:P0D
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nudge 2/60: Turn towards the small stuff
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261103T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261103T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-they-2026-11-02-2@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Today\, every time they point something out (a headline
 \, a dog in the street\, a message from a friend) stop and respond properl
 y. Look up\, put the phone face down\, ask one question about it.\n\nWHY I
 T WORKS: Relationship researchers call these 'bids for connection'. In a w
 ell-known study of newlyweds\, couples still together six years later had 
 turned towards each other's small bids far more often than couples who spl
 it.\n\nDay 2 of 60 · Week 1: Notice\n\nTCH Works · Better Partner Plan. 
 Everyday relationship ideas\, not therapy or counselling. If things feel u
 nsafe or overwhelming\, talk to your GP or a relationship counselling serv
 ice. In an emergency call 999.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.tchworks.co.uk/planners/u/185521ab6e704744/
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Nudge 2/60: Turn towards the small stuff
TRIGGER:P0D
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nudge 3/60: The first five minutes
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261104T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261104T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-they-2026-11-02-3@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: When you next see them today\, give the first five minu
 tes to them\, not to logistics. Greet them properly\, ask how the day went
 \, listen. Who's picking up whom and what's for tea can wait five minutes.
 \n\nWHY IT WORKS: Reunions set the tone for the evening. A warm one costs 
 nothing and is easy to make a habit.\n\nDay 3 of 60 · Week 1: Notice\n\nT
 CH Works · Better Partner Plan. Everyday relationship ideas\, not therapy
  or counselling. If things feel unsafe or overwhelming\, talk to your GP o
 r a relationship counselling service. In an emergency call 999.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.tchworks.co.uk/planners/u/185521ab6e704744/
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Nudge 3/60: The first five minutes
TRIGGER:P0D
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nudge 4/60: Do one thing from their list
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261105T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261105T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-they-2026-11-02-4@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Find one job that has been sitting on their to-do list 
 (the dentist booking\, the parcel return\, the form for school) and do it
 \, start to finish\, without being asked. Tell them once it's done\, not b
 efore.\n\nWHY IT WORKS: Taking a whole task off someone's plate is worth m
 ore than offering to 'help with' it.\n\nDay 4 of 60 · Week 1: Notice\n\nT
 CH Works · Better Partner Plan. Everyday relationship ideas\, not therapy
  or counselling. If things feel unsafe or overwhelming\, talk to your GP o
 r a relationship counselling service. In an emergency call 999.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.tchworks.co.uk/planners/u/185521ab6e704744/
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Nudge 4/60: Do one thing from their list
TRIGGER:P0D
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nudge 5/60: Ask about the thing
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261106T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261106T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-they-2026-11-02-5@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Think back to something they mentioned earlier this wee
 k: a meeting\, a worry\, a friend's news. Ask how it went\, using the deta
 il. 'How did the meeting with Sam go? Did they go for the new rota?'\n\nWH
 Y IT WORKS: Remembering the detail tells them that what they say sticks wi
 th you.\n\nDay 5 of 60 · Week 1: Notice\n\nTCH Works · Better Partner Pl
 an. Everyday relationship ideas\, not therapy or counselling. If things fe
 el unsafe or overwhelming\, talk to your GP or a relationship counselling 
 service. In an emergency call 999.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.tchworks.co.uk/planners/u/185521ab6e704744/
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Nudge 5/60: Ask about the thing
TRIGGER:P0D
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nudge 6/60: Make it exactly right
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261107T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261107T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-they-2026-11-02-6@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Make them a drink or a snack exactly the way they like 
 it\, without asking how they take it. If you're not sure\, that's today's 
 job: find out and remember.\n\nWHY IT WORKS: Small acts of care done preci
 sely land better than big gestures done generally.\n\nDay 6 of 60 · Week 
 1: Notice\n\nTCH Works · Better Partner Plan. Everyday relationship ideas
 \, not therapy or counselling. If things feel unsafe or overwhelming\, tal
 k to your GP or a relationship counselling service. In an emergency call 9
 99.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.tchworks.co.uk/planners/u/185521ab6e704744/
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Nudge 6/60: Make it exactly right
TRIGGER:P0D
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nudge 7/60: First weekly check-in (15 minutes)
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261108T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261108T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-they-2026-11-02-7@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Find 15 calm minutes today. Ask two questions and only 
 listen: 'What's one thing I did this week that you liked?' and 'What's one
  thing that would make next week easier for you?' Don't defend or explain.
  Say thanks\, and pick one thing to act on.\n\nWHY IT WORKS: A short\, reg
 ular check-in keeps small irritations small. It works best when it's routi
 ne\, not only when something's wrong.\n\nDay 7 of 60 · Week 1: Notice\n\n
 TCH Works · Better Partner Plan. Everyday relationship ideas\, not therap
 y or counselling. If things feel unsafe or overwhelming\, talk to your GP 
 or a relationship counselling service. In an emergency call 999.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.tchworks.co.uk/planners/u/185521ab6e704744/
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Nudge 7/60: First weekly check-in (15 minutes)
TRIGGER:P0D
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nudge 8/60: Praise them to someone else
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261109T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261109T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-they-2026-11-02-8@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Today\, say something good about them to someone else: 
 a friend\, your parents\, the kids. Even better if they can hear it.\n\nWH
 Y IT WORKS: Hearing yourself praised to other people feels different from 
 a private compliment. It says 'I'm proud of you'\, not just 'thanks'.\n\nD
 ay 8 of 60 · Week 2: Say it out loud\n\nTCH Works · Better Partner Plan.
  Everyday relationship ideas\, not therapy or counselling. If things feel 
 unsafe or overwhelming\, talk to your GP or a relationship counselling ser
 vice. In an emergency call 999.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.tchworks.co.uk/planners/u/185521ab6e704744/
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Nudge 8/60: Praise them to someone else
TRIGGER:P0D
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nudge 9/60: Respond to good news properly
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261110T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261110T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-they-2026-11-02-9@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: When they share any good news today\, however small\, r
 espond with real interest: ask questions\, let them tell the whole story\,
  be pleased out loud. 'Hang on\, tell me exactly what she said.'\n\nWHY IT
  WORKS: Research on how couples respond to each other's good news found th
 at enthusiastic\, engaged responses were linked to happier relationships. 
 A distracted 'nice' can quietly do the opposite.\n\nDay 9 of 60 · Week 2:
  Say it out loud\n\nTCH Works · Better Partner Plan. Everyday relationshi
 p ideas\, not therapy or counselling. If things feel unsafe or overwhelmin
 g\, talk to your GP or a relationship counselling service. In an emergency
  call 999.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.tchworks.co.uk/planners/u/185521ab6e704744/
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Nudge 9/60: Respond to good news properly
TRIGGER:P0D
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nudge 10/60: A note where they'll find it
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261111T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261111T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-they-2026-11-02-10@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Write one line by hand and leave it where they'll find 
 it tomorrow: the kettle\, the car seat\, a coat pocket\, a lunch box. Make
  it specific: 'You were brilliant with Dad on Sunday.'\n\nWHY IT WORKS: A 
 note keeps working after you've written it. Many people keep them for year
 s.\n\nDay 10 of 60 · Week 2: Say it out loud\n\nTCH Works · Better Partn
 er Plan. Everyday relationship ideas\, not therapy or counselling. If thin
 gs feel unsafe or overwhelming\, talk to your GP or a relationship counsel
 ling service. In an emergency call 999.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.tchworks.co.uk/planners/u/185521ab6e704744/
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Nudge 10/60: A note where they'll find it
TRIGGER:P0D
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nudge 11/60: Say what you admire
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261112T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261112T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-they-2026-11-02-11@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Tell them one quality you admire that has nothing to do
  with what they do for you. 'I love how patient you are with your mum when
  she's anxious.' 'You're the funniest person in any room.'\n\nWHY IT WORKS
 : Appreciating who someone is\, not just what they do\, builds a sense of 
 being seen.\n\nDay 11 of 60 · Week 2: Say it out loud\n\nTCH Works · Bet
 ter Partner Plan. Everyday relationship ideas\, not therapy or counselling
 . If things feel unsafe or overwhelming\, talk to your GP or a relationshi
 p counselling service. In an emergency call 999.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.tchworks.co.uk/planners/u/185521ab6e704744/
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Nudge 11/60: Say what you admire
TRIGGER:P0D
END:VALARM
