BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nudge 12/60: Ask for their advice
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261113T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261113T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-they-2026-11-02-12@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Ask their opinion on something real you're deciding: wo
 rk\, a purchase\, how to handle a friend. Listen properly. If you don't ta
 ke the advice\, explain why.\n\nWHY IT WORKS: Asking for advice is a quiet
  form of respect. It says 'I trust your judgement'.\n\nDay 12 of 60 · Wee
 k 2: Say it out loud\n\nTCH Works · Better Partner Plan. Everyday relatio
 nship ideas\, not therapy or counselling. If things feel unsafe or overwhe
 lming\, talk to your GP or a relationship counselling service. In an emerg
 ency call 999.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.tchworks.co.uk/planners/u/185521ab6e704744/
