BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nudge 13/60: The 'I remember' message
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261114T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261114T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-they-2026-11-02-13@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Send them a message about a specific happy memory of th
 e two of you. 'I was just thinking about that tiny café in Whitby when th
 e rain came in sideways.'\n\nWHY IT WORKS: Going back over good shared mem
 ories together is linked to feeling closer. It also tends to start a nice 
 conversation later.\n\nDay 13 of 60 · Week 2: Say it out loud\n\nTCH Work
 s · Better Partner Plan. Everyday relationship ideas\, not therapy or cou
 nselling. If things feel unsafe or overwhelming\, talk to your GP or a rel
 ationship counselling service. In an emergency call 999.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.tchworks.co.uk/planners/u/185521ab6e704744/
