BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nudge 14/60: Second check-in
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261115T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261115T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-they-2026-11-02-14@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Same 15 minutes as last week. Ask: 'What's been the bes
 t bit of this week for you?' and 'Is there anything you need from me next 
 week?' Listen\, thank them\, pick one thing.\n\nWHY IT WORKS: Doing it a s
 econd time is what turns it into a habit rather than a one-off.\n\nDay 14 
 of 60 · Week 2: Say it out loud\n\nTCH Works · Better Partner Plan. Ever
 yday relationship ideas\, not therapy or counselling. If things feel unsaf
 e or overwhelming\, talk to your GP or a relationship counselling service.
  In an emergency call 999.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.tchworks.co.uk/planners/u/185521ab6e704744/
