BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nudge 15/60: Own a whole job
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261116T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261116T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-they-2026-11-02-15@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Choose one recurring household job and take it over com
 pletely: the noticing\, planning and doing. Bins\, packed lunches\, the sc
 hool WhatsApp\, birthday presents for your side of the family. Tell them t
 oday: 'That's mine now. You don't need to think about it again.'\n\nWHY IT
  WORKS: A lot of household strain comes from the 'mental load': rememberin
 g\, planning and checking\, not just doing. Owning a job entirely removes 
 it from their head\, not just their hands.\n\nDay 15 of 60 · Week 3: Ligh
 ten the load\n\nTCH Works · Better Partner Plan. Everyday relationship id
 eas\, not therapy or counselling. If things feel unsafe or overwhelming\, 
 talk to your GP or a relationship counselling service. In an emergency cal
 l 999.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.tchworks.co.uk/planners/u/185521ab6e704744/
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Nudge 15/60: Own a whole job
TRIGGER:P0D
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nudge 16/60: Notice before you're asked
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261117T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261117T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-they-2026-11-02-16@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Today\, find three things that need doing that you'd no
 rmally wait to be told about (the full bin\, the empty loo roll\, the wash
 ing in the machine). Do them. Don't mention it.\n\nWHY IT WORKS: Being the
  person who notices is part of the work. It's often the part that goes uns
 een.\n\nDay 16 of 60 · Week 3: Lighten the load\n\nTCH Works · Better Pa
 rtner Plan. Everyday relationship ideas\, not therapy or counselling. If t
 hings feel unsafe or overwhelming\, talk to your GP or a relationship coun
 selling service. In an emergency call 999.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.tchworks.co.uk/planners/u/185521ab6e704744/
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Nudge 16/60: Notice before you're asked
TRIGGER:P0D
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nudge 17/60: Clear the evening
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261118T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261118T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-they-2026-11-02-17@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Tell them this morning that tonight is covered: you're 
 doing tea\, the washing up and anything else that comes up after 7pm. Then
  do it\, without commentary.\n\nWHY IT WORKS: Knowing in the morning that 
 the evening is free gives them something to look forward to all day.\n\nDa
 y 17 of 60 · Week 3: Lighten the load\n\nTCH Works · Better Partner Plan
 . Everyday relationship ideas\, not therapy or counselling. If things feel
  unsafe or overwhelming\, talk to your GP or a relationship counselling se
 rvice. In an emergency call 999.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.tchworks.co.uk/planners/u/185521ab6e704744/
