BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nudge 20/60: An evening to themselves
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261121T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261121T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-they-2026-11-02-20@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Arrange an evening this week where they have no respons
 ibilities at all. You handle the house\, the food\, the kids and the tidyi
 ng\, and they choose what to do: a bath\, friends\, the cinema\, nothing a
 t all. Set it up today. On the night\, don't ring with questions.\n\nWHY I
 T WORKS: Time that's genuinely free\, not 'free but on call'\, is rare for
  most adults with families. It's one of the most valued things you can giv
 e.\n\nDay 20 of 60 · Week 3: Lighten the load\n\nTCH Works · Better Part
 ner Plan. Everyday relationship ideas\, not therapy or counselling. If thi
 ngs feel unsafe or overwhelming\, talk to your GP or a relationship counse
 lling service. In an emergency call 999.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
