DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261122T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-they-2026-11-02-21@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Ask: 'Is there anything you're carrying at the moment t
 hat I don't see?' Write down the answer. Pick one thing to take on and tel
 l them which.\n\nWHY IT WORKS: Asking directly is the fastest way to find 
 the invisible jobs.\n\nDay 21 of 60 · Week 3: Lighten the load\n\nTCH Wor
 ks · Better Partner Plan. Everyday relationship ideas\, not therapy or co
 unselling. If things feel unsafe or overwhelming\, talk to your GP or a re
 lationship counselling service. In an emergency call 999.
