BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nudge 22/60: Phones away for one meal
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261123T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261123T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-they-2026-11-02-22@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: At one meal today\, both phones go in another room. If 
 it feels awkward\, ask: 'What's been the best and worst bit of your day?'
 \n\nWHY IT WORKS: Even having a phone on the table can make a conversation
  feel less close. Removing it is the simplest upgrade there is.\n\nDay 22 
 of 60 · Week 4: Time and attention\n\nTCH Works · Better Partner Plan. E
 veryday relationship ideas\, not therapy or counselling. If things feel un
 safe or overwhelming\, talk to your GP or a relationship counselling servi
 ce. In an emergency call 999.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.tchworks.co.uk/planners/u/185521ab6e704744/
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
