SUMMARY:Nudge 23/60: Ten minutes\, not about logistics
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261124T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261124T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-they-2026-11-02-23@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Find ten minutes today to talk about anything except th
 e kids\, the house\, work admin or money. Try: 'What's on your mind lately
  that we haven't talked about?'\n\nWHY IT WORKS: Couples with busy lives c
 an go weeks talking only about logistics. Ten minutes of real conversation
  keeps you friends\, not just co-managers.\n\nDay 23 of 60 · Week 4: Time
  and attention\n\nTCH Works · Better Partner Plan. Everyday relationship 
 ideas\, not therapy or counselling. If things feel unsafe or overwhelming
 \, talk to your GP or a relationship counselling service. In an emergency 
 call 999.
