DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261125T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-they-2026-11-02-24@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Plan a date in the next fortnight and organise every pa
 rt: when\, where\, the booking and the childcare or dog-sitting. Then tell
  them the time to be ready. It doesn't need to cost much. A walk and chips
  counts.\n\nWHY IT WORKS: The planning is the gift. Being asked 'what do y
 ou want to do?' can feel like one more job.\n\nDay 24 of 60 · Week 4: Tim
 e and attention\n\nTCH Works · Better Partner Plan. Everyday relationship
  ideas\, not therapy or counselling. If things feel unsafe or overwhelming
 \, talk to your GP or a relationship counselling service. In an emergency 
 call 999.
