UID:tch-better-partner-they-2026-11-02-26@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Next time you hug them today\, don't be the first to le
 t go.\n\nWHY IT WORKS: Unhurried physical affection is a simple\, low-effo
 rt way to feel close. It's easy to make this a daily habit.\n\nDay 26 of 6
 0 · Week 4: Time and attention\n\nTCH Works · Better Partner Plan. Every
 day relationship ideas\, not therapy or counselling. If things feel unsafe
  or overwhelming\, talk to your GP or a relationship counselling service. 
 In an emergency call 999.
