SUMMARY:Nudge 27/60: Ask a better question
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261128T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261128T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-they-2026-11-02-27@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Instead of 'How was your day?'\, ask one of these: 'Wha
 t made you laugh today?'\, 'What's the thing you're most looking forward t
 o this week?'\, 'What was the most annoying thing today?' Then ask one fol
 low-up question.\n\nWHY IT WORKS: Specific questions get real answers. Gen
 eric ones get 'fine'.\n\nDay 27 of 60 · Week 4: Time and attention\n\nTCH
  Works · Better Partner Plan. Everyday relationship ideas\, not therapy o
 r counselling. If things feel unsafe or overwhelming\, talk to your GP or 
 a relationship counselling service. In an emergency call 999.
