DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-they-2026-11-02-28@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Ask: 'When did you feel most looked after by me this mo
 nth?' Then: 'What's one thing I could do more of?' Write the answers in yo
 ur phone.\n\nWHY IT WORKS: The answers are your best guide to what actuall
 y lands for them.\n\nDay 28 of 60 · Week 4: Time and attention\n\nTCH Wor
 ks · Better Partner Plan. Everyday relationship ideas\, not therapy or co
 unselling. If things feel unsafe or overwhelming\, talk to your GP or a re
 lationship counselling service. In an emergency call 999.
