DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261130T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261130T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-they-2026-11-02-29@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Ask them one of these today and really listen: 'What di
 d you want to be when you were ten?'\, 'What's a smell that takes you stra
 ight back to childhood?'\, 'What's the best piece of advice you've ever be
 en given?'\n\nWHY IT WORKS: However long you've been together\, there's al
 ways more to find out. Curiosity is a sign of interest\, and people feel i
 t.\n\nDay 29 of 60 · Week 5: Be curious\n\nTCH Works · Better Partner Pl
 an. Everyday relationship ideas\, not therapy or counselling. If things fe
 el unsafe or overwhelming\, talk to your GP or a relationship counselling 
 service. In an emergency call 999.
