DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261201T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-they-2026-11-02-30@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Ask about one of their friends by name: how they're doi
 ng\, what's going on in their life. Remember the answer for next time.\n\n
 WHY IT WORKS: Caring about the people who matter to them is a way of carin
 g about them.\n\nDay 30 of 60 · Week 5: Be curious\n\nTCH Works · Better
  Partner Plan. Everyday relationship ideas\, not therapy or counselling. I
 f things feel unsafe or overwhelming\, talk to your GP or a relationship c
 ounselling service. In an emergency call 999.
