SUMMARY:Nudge 33/60: A good memory from before you met
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261204T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261204T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-they-2026-11-02-33@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Ask them about a happy memory from before you met: a ho
 liday\, a job\, a friend\, a place. Ask what made it so good.\n\nWHY IT WO
 RKS: Hearing the stories that shaped someone helps you understand what mat
 ters to them now.\n\nDay 33 of 60 · Week 5: Be curious\n\nTCH Works · Be
 tter Partner Plan. Everyday relationship ideas\, not therapy or counsellin
 g. If things feel unsafe or overwhelming\, talk to your GP or a relationsh
 ip counselling service. In an emergency call 999.
