DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-they-2026-11-02-37@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Send them something today that you know will make them 
 laugh: a photo\, a memory\, a terrible joke.\n\nWHY IT WORKS: Shared laugh
 ter is one of the fastest ways to feel on the same side.\n\nDay 37 of 60 
 · Week 6: Play and try new things\n\nTCH Works · Better Partner Plan. Ev
 eryday relationship ideas\, not therapy or counselling. If things feel uns
 afe or overwhelming\, talk to your GP or a relationship counselling servic
 e. In an emergency call 999.
