DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-they-2026-11-02-38@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Make their favourite meal tonight\, or the closest you 
 can manage. Lay the table properly.\n\nWHY IT WORKS: It says 'I know you' 
 in a way that's hard to say in words.\n\nDay 38 of 60 · Week 6: Play and 
 try new things\n\nTCH Works · Better Partner Plan. Everyday relationship 
 ideas\, not therapy or counselling. If things feel unsafe or overwhelming
