UID:tch-better-partner-they-2026-11-02-40@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Suggest revisiting a place that means something to you 
 both: where you first met\, a favourite pub\, a walk you used to do. Plan 
 it for this week or next.\n\nWHY IT WORKS: Revisiting shared places remind
 s you both of your story together.\n\nDay 40 of 60 · Week 6: Play and try
  new things\n\nTCH Works · Better Partner Plan. Everyday relationship ide
 as\, not therapy or counselling. If things feel unsafe or overwhelming\, t
 alk to your GP or a relationship counselling service. In an emergency call
  999.
