DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Suggest a game tonight: cards\, a board game\, a quiz\,
  twenty questions. Keep it light and a little competitive.\n\nWHY IT WORKS
 : Play is easy to drop when life gets busy. It's also one of the things co
 uples miss most.\n\nDay 41 of 60 · Week 6: Play and try new things\n\nTCH
  Works · Better Partner Plan. Everyday relationship ideas\, not therapy o
 r counselling. If things feel unsafe or overwhelming\, talk to your GP or 
 a relationship counselling service. In an emergency call 999.
