UID:tch-better-partner-they-2026-11-02-42@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Ask: 'What's been the most fun we've had recently?' and
  'What should we do more of?' Book or plan one thing from the answer.\n\nW
 HY IT WORKS: Fun doesn't happen by itself in a busy life. It needs a date 
 in the diary.\n\nDay 42 of 60 · Week 6: Play and try new things\n\nTCH Wo
 rks · Better Partner Plan. Everyday relationship ideas\, not therapy or c
 ounselling. If things feel unsafe or overwhelming\, talk to your GP or a r
 elationship counselling service. In an emergency call 999.
