BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nudge 43/60: Start gently
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261214T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261214T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-they-2026-11-02-43@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: If there's something you need to raise today\, start wi
 th what you feel and what you'd like\, not with what they always do. Inste
 ad of 'You never put anything away'\, try 'I'm feeling swamped by the clut
 ter. Could we do ten minutes tonight together?'\n\nWHY IT WORKS: How a dif
 ficult conversation starts strongly predicts how it ends. A gentle start m
 akes defensiveness much less likely.\n\nDay 43 of 60 · Week 7: Handle the
  hard bits well\n\nTCH Works · Better Partner Plan. Everyday relationship
  ideas\, not therapy or counselling. If things feel unsafe or overwhelming
 \, talk to your GP or a relationship counselling service. In an emergency 
 call 999.
