BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nudge 45/60: Assume the best
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261216T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261216T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-they-2026-11-02-45@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Next time something they do annoys you today\, pause an
 d think of the most generous explanation before reacting. Tired? Didn't no
 tice? Trying to help?\n\nWHY IT WORKS: Happier couples tend to give each o
 ther the benefit of the doubt. It's a habit\, and it can be practised.\n\n
 Day 45 of 60 · Week 7: Handle the hard bits well\n\nTCH Works · Better P
 artner Plan. Everyday relationship ideas\, not therapy or counselling. If 
 things feel unsafe or overwhelming\, talk to your GP or a relationship cou
 nselling service. In an emergency call 999.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.tchworks.co.uk/planners/u/185521ab6e704744/
