BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nudge 46/60: Agree how to take a break
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261217T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261217T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-they-2026-11-02-46@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: At a calm moment\, agree a way to pause an argument tha
 t's getting heated: a word or phrase either of you can use\, and a promise
  to come back to it within the hour. Agree on at least 20 minutes apart to
  calm down.\n\nWHY IT WORKS: When people are flooded with stress mid-argum
 ent\, they can't listen well. A planned break\, with a promise to return\,
  helps more than pushing on.\n\nDay 46 of 60 · Week 7: Handle the hard bi
 ts well\n\nTCH Works · Better Partner Plan. Everyday relationship ideas\,
  not therapy or counselling. If things feel unsafe or overwhelming\, talk 
 to your GP or a relationship counselling service. In an emergency call 999
 .
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
