 t you pushed back on: a different film\, a weekend plan\, moving the sofa.
  Say yes to it today\, happily.\n\nWHY IT WORKS: Being open to your partne
 r's influence is one of the habits most linked to stable relationships.\n
 \nDay 47 of 60 · Week 7: Handle the hard bits well\n\nTCH Works · Better
  Partner Plan. Everyday relationship ideas\, not therapy or counselling. I
 f things feel unsafe or overwhelming\, talk to your GP or a relationship c
 ounselling service. In an emergency call 999.
